{"title": "US Sanctions International Criminal Court", "summary": "The United States has imposed sanctions on the International Criminal Court (ICC). The ICC stated that the move aims to intimidate its staff and cooperators and that it \"will not be deterred.\" The court described the US action as an \"assault on the rule of law.\" The sanctions were announced hours after a former ICC judge won the Nobel Peace Prize. Some reports indicate the US sanctions are part of a drive to dismantle the tribunal.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "अमेरिका ने अंतर्राष्ट्रीय आपराधिक न्यायालय पर प्रतिबंध लगाए", "summary_hi": "संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिका ने अंतर्राष्ट्रीय आपराधिक न्यायालय (आईसीसी) पर प्रतिबंध लगा दिए हैं। आईसीसी ने कहा कि इस कदम का उद्देश्य उसके कर्मचारियों और सहयोगियों को डराना है और वह \"डरेगी नहीं\"। अदालत ने अमेरिकी कार्रवाई को \"कानून के शासन पर हमला\" बताया। ये प्रतिबंध पूर्व आईसीसी न्यायाधीश को नोबेल शांति पुरस्कार मिलने के कुछ घंटे बाद लगाए गए। कुछ रिपोर्टों से पता चलता है कि अमेरिकी प्रतिबंध न्यायाधिकरण को खत्म करने के प्रयास का हिस्सा हैं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Emphasized the ICC's rejection of the sanctions, quoting its statement that the move aims to \"intimidate staff, cooperators\" and that the court \"will not be deterred.\"", "Highlighted the ICC's characterization of the US sanctions as an \"assault on the rule of law.\"", "Noted the timing of the sanctions, occurring hours after a former ICC judge won the Nobel Peace Prize."], "right": ["Framed the US sanctions as part of a drive to \"dismantle\" the tribunal."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["आईसीसी द्वारा प्रतिबंधों को खारिज करने पर जोर दिया, उसके इस बयान का हवाला देते हुए कि इस कदम का उद्देश्य \"कर्मचारियों, सहयोगियों को डराना\" है और अदालत \"डरेगी नहीं\"।", "अमेरिकी प्रतिबंधों को \"कानून के शासन पर हमला\" के रूप में आईसीसी के चित्रण को उजागर किया।", "प्रतिबंधों के समय पर ध्यान दिया, जो पूर्व आईसीसी न्यायाधीश द्वारा नोबेल शांति पुरस्कार जीतने के कुछ घंटे बाद हुए।"], "right": ["अमेरिकी प्रतिबंधों को न्यायाधिकरण को \"खत्म करने\" के प्रयास के हिस्से के रूप में प्रस्तुत किया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": "2026-10-09T22:02:00", "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US Imposes Sanctions on International Criminal Court, Hours After Former Judge Wins Nobel"}, {"source": "The Tribune", "owner": "The Tribune", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "“Will not be deterred”: ICC rejects US sanctions, says move aims to intimidate staff, cooperators"}, {"source": "The Financial Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US imposes fresh sanctions on ICC; court calls move an ‘assault on rule of law’"}, {"source": "The Hindu BusinessLine", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US imposes sanctions on International Criminal Court, hours after former judge wins Nobel"}, {"source": "Outlook India", "owner": "Outlook India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US Imposes Sanctions On ICC Hours After Former Judge Wins Nobel Peace Prize"}, {"source": "Le Monde", "owner": "Le Monde", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US imposes sanctions on ICC, hours after Nobel award to former judge"}, {"source": "Financial Times", "owner": "Financial Times", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNQ3Jja2VxRmh0SXp0ZzVlam5xWS1uMUxNZnpyUlRhQ3QxVXJjX3IzSUZyRkZUSEFKUWNmZTVhbVh6SEJPeFlNOFlycnY4bkhVZVBpVW90ZkhZTXlza0QyVUxEOTdkZm1QaDYwbXVOQ1YtVmlsd1BkcE93X25yWVlWcktqMkU?oc=5", "headline": "US announces sanctions campaign to ‘end’ ICC"}, {"source": "Toronto Star